      "raw_text": "[8:13PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nBabajide Sanwo-Olu Road to Swipha is moving smoothly, while Akowonjo Roundabout to Shasha Traffic Light handles a high volume efficiently. \nVulcanizer Bus Stop inw Ogunlana Junction stretch is busy but flowing steadily, and Cement to Alaguntan Junction is bustling yet well-coordinated. \nThanks to strategically deployed traffic officers, the traffic flow remains steady across segments with no reported impediments.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
      "cleaned_text": "[8:13PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate Babajide Sanwo-Olu Road to Swipha is moving smoothly, while Akowonjo Roundabout to Shasha Traffic Light handles a high volume efficiently. Vulcanizer Bus Stop inw Ogunlana Junction stretch is busy but flowing steadily, and Cement to Alaguntan Junction is bustling yet well-coordinated. Thanks to strategically deployed traffic officers, the traffic flow remains steady across segments with no reported impediments. #FollowLASTMA",
      "english_translation": "[8:13PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate Babajide Sanwo-Olu Road to Swipha is moving smoothly, while Akowonjo Roundabout to Shasha Traffic Light handles a high volume efficiently. Vulcanizer Bus Stop inw Ogunlana Junction stretch is busy but flowing steadily, and Cement to Alaguntan Junction is bustling yet well-coordinated. Thanks to strategically deployed traffic officers, the traffic flow remains steady across segments with no reported impediments. #FollowLASTMA",
